 when the tablet is cut, nothing when it is not`),L9(`ask-best-weight`,`D8`,`weigh`,`Lighter or heavier than her best weight (Sunny)`,`always there for Sunny, 2 forms`),L9(`taught`,`D9`,null,`How a new thing is taught: shown, led, or not at all`,`by the player’s record, in each ask above`),L9(`stretch`,`D10`,null,`A stretch: an ask one step up from the player’s level`,`about 6 times in 10 when allowed, never first in the day or twice running`),L9(`aid`,`D11`,null,`The aid: a band that glows, a number that is lit`,`by the player’s rung and the player’s record`),L9(`wrong-note`,`E1`,`arrive`,`The owner's note: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-scale`,`E2`,`weigh`,`The scale: the first miss brings the dial up big, the second the plain showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-small-scale`,`E3`,`weigh-small`,`The small scale: the same two showings`,z9),L9(`wrong-heart`,`E4`,`heart`,`The heart: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-temp`,`E5`,`temperature`,`The thermometer: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-clock`,`E6`,`drop-clock`,`The clock: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-flea-box`,`E7`,`flea-medicine`,`The flea medicine box: a cat box where a dog box is wrong, and the dog box stops`,z9),L9(`wrong-dandruff-box`,`E8`,`dandruff-medicine`,`The dandruff medicine box: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-tick-box`,`E9`,`tick-medicine`,`The tick medicine box: the other animal's box`,z9),L9(`wrong-food`,`E10`,`food-pick`,`The food tile: a full bowl and no food`,z9),L9(`wrong-trim`,`E11`,`nail`,`Where to trim the nail: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-worm-row`,`E12`,`worm-tablet`,`The worming chart row: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-side`,`E13`,`found`,`Left or right: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-change`,`E14`,`better`,`Change at the till, and how much we keep: their own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-cough-home`,`E15`,`cough-home`,`The resting place and the collar: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-calendar`,`E16`,`cough-days`,`The calendar: its own showing`,z9),L9(`wrong-tick-tool`,`E17`,`tick-out`,`The tick tool: finger